      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-04-18T16:34:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I just got an update from the shipping company. The container of GSF should be delivered to our warehouse before the end of May, but not by a lot (the factory did something foolish that resulted in a few days unnecessary delay). We plan to pack rewards as fast as humanly possible over Memorial Day Weekend to get these out before the end of the month; we will update the GSF Kickstarter with more concrete info as soon as we have it!</p>",
